  {
   "id": "s1",
   "title": "Use i²=−1",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&k^{2}=\\frac{3}{25}\\ \\Rightarrow\\ z^{2}+k^{2}=z^{2}-(ki)^{2}\\ \\text{because}\\ (ki)^{2}=-k^{2}\\\\[5pt]&k=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{5}\\end{aligned}\\]",
